[en.IDEA_ALL_RESISTANCE]
Resistance

[en.IDEA_ALL_RESISTANCE_desc]
This country is a resistance force that denies the Canterlot Pact and opposes the rule of the Big Three, hoping to restore the world before the Ultimate Battle. Due to the hasty uprising, the suppression of the Big Three and the forces that support the status quo, as well as the internal chaos in the revolution team, the current situation of the country is not optimistic. Nevertheless, the ideals and beliefs of pursuing freedom, harmony, equality or other goals have become the spiritual pillar of the resistance movement.

[zh.IDEA_ALL_RESISTANCE]
抵抗组织

[zh.IDEA_ALL_RESISTANCE_desc]
这个国家是拒绝承认《坎特洛特协定》现状，反对三巨头统治，希望恢复终末之战前的世界而形成的抵抗运动。由于起义的仓促、三巨头和拥护现状势力的镇压、抵抗运动的队伍鱼龙混杂，国家现状并不乐观。尽管如此，追求自由、谐律、平等或其他目标的理想和信念成为了抵抗运动的精神支柱。
